# Generated audio assets - NOT in git on purpose (keeps the repo text-only).
# They are produced from the committed generator scripts; run both before building:
#     python Tools/_gen_audio.py   (sfx_tap / sfx_select / sfx_back / sfx_tick + bgm take 1)
#     python Tools/_gen_bgm.py     (bgm_shell, seamless loop - overwrites the take-1 bgm)
# Requires ffmpeg with libvorbis on PATH. See BUILD.md, Audio Assets section.
# notif_chime.ogg has NO committed generator yet - see the note in BUILD.md.
app/src/main/res/raw/*.ogg
app/src/main/res/raw/*.wav

# Raw puzzle source dump (2.7 MB Lichess export). The runtime asset
# games/chess/puzzles.js IS committed; regenerate it with:
#     python Tools/_gen_puzzles.py
sources/LockedGames/chess_puzzles.txt
# One-off debugging scratch from device sessions (the committed tooling is
# Tools/_gen_puzzles.py / Tools/_install_chess.py / Tools/_validate_chess.js /
# Tools/_check_chess_syntax.js)
_cd*.js
_pm_probe.py
_fix_pm.py
_u*.xml
build_out.txt

